window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>One look. One kiss. One night. One lifetime.</b></p> <p>King Stanley is the vice president of an MC. Shawn Cotton is the small-town bakery owner.</p> <p>He's not looking for more than one night. Her bakery is failing—epically.</p> <p>She's the sweetest thing he's ever laid eyes on. He's everything she doesn't need.</p> <p>Their stolen moment together was a distraction. It wasn't meant to last forever.</p> <p>She could be the best thing that's ever happened to him. He could be everything she dreamed of and more.</p>"; 
